# Music Lessons on the Sunshine Coast

Did you know Music Lessons in African Drumming are held every week in Palmwoods on the Sunshine Coast? Music Lessons in African drumming start March 10th @ Palmwoods Memorial Hall. There will be a new rhythm, new faces and of course new dance moves (in the dance class) in this next 5 week block which will take us into the first week of the school holidays. Upcoming dates for the music lessons are March 10, March 17, March 24, March 31, April 7th. Palmwoods is our hub for West African culture with a Beginners music lesson from 5.30-630pm, Experienced music lesson from 6.30-7:30pm and African Dancing from 7.30-8:30pm which students are welcome to stay and drum for. Five weeks of lessons for $99 and if you need a drum it is $4 per session. And to make it easy you can now [book in online](/product/5-drumming-classes-sunshine-coast/). Dancers there will be a new rhythm starting and we welcome all dancers to bring a move for the w can now book in onarm up routine. As usual this class will be informally led by a collection of our dancers. Yay! Dancers $7 Drumming students $4. Look forward to seeing you all again!
